      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Suddenly, alarms echo through the monastery courtyard as enemy invaders break through the gates. Monk Konstantin urges Father Grigory to flee, but Father Grigory knows time has run out. He orders Konstantin to take the precious handwritten chronicle and hide it safely in the cellar. Let's listen to their tense exchange in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
